; Message privileged Signal.
;
; The meta socket answers the configured owner and the flows whose aspect
; is in MetaAspects; every other peer is answered MetaRefused. The owner
; Sends here, stamped Owner. Redeliver is the only way out of Uncertain:
; it hands Flow a new delivery of the same message to the same recipient.
;
; Configure is stored and applied. The Flow socket paths and MetaAspects
; take effect on the next call (Applied); a changed own socket path takes
; effect when the Nexus restarts (NexusRestartRequired).

Signal
[ signal_flow:[ FlowId ] meta_signal_flow:[ MetaAspects MetaRefusal ] signal_message:[ MessageId SendRequest Submission SendRejection Receipt MessageRejection ] ]
[ Configure.MessageConfiguration Send.SendRequest Redeliver.RedeliverRequest ]
[ Configured.Configured ConfigureRejected.ConfigureRejection Submitted.Submission SendRejected.SendRejection Redelivered.Receipt RedeliverRejected.MessageRejection MetaRefused.MetaRefusal ]
[ OrdinarySocketPath.String
  MetaSocketPath.String
  FlowSocketPath.String
  FlowMetaSocketPath.String
  MessageConfiguration.{ OrdinarySocketPath MetaSocketPath FlowSocketPath FlowMetaSocketPath MetaAspects }
  RedeliverRequest.{ MessageId FlowId }
  Activation.[ Applied NexusRestartRequired ]
  Configured.{ MessageConfiguration Activation }
  ConfigureRejection.[ StoreRefused ] ]
